        <mxCell id="kU7kLik72AI9dNdhKyc5-109" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Demo of how the travel table works with 7.&lt;div&gt;Show original data and decoded data. Discuss sets&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;of words. Show how &quot;DOW&quot; for slit is shadowed (Woods fixes this).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Discuss the &quot;You don&#39;t fit&quot; room and show that decoded. Woods enhanced the travel info to allow for print and stay. Discuss later.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;woods left the travel table alone here except for the new message features. He fixed the DOWN in 7. Tweaked word list. Pulled BACK.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Rooms 17 and 18 are freed up and used in the plant sequence. Could have freed up 4F, but left it as a room.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="291.05" width="490" x="-6640.5" y="-2913.4100000000003" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
